{%- comment -%}
  Senseless — Organization schema. SUPERSEDED, deliberately kept.

  The Organization node now lives in the sitewide @graph emitted by
  snippets/senseless-structured-data.liquid at {shop.url}/#organization, on EVERY page type
  rather than on the two templates that happened to include this section. Emitting it here as
  well would put two Organization nodes on the About and Contact pages with no @id relating
  them — the exact duplication the graph rewrite removed.

  The section is retained (rather than deleted) because templates/page.about.json and
  templates/page.contact.json still reference it; removing a referenced section type is a
  storefront error, and the settings below are the record of what the node used to carry. It
  renders nothing. If you are adding organisation data, add it to the #organization node in
  snippets/senseless-structured-data.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Senseless — Org schema",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "senseless-section senseless-org-schema",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Superseded. Organization JSON-LD is now emitted sitewide from snippets/senseless-structured-data.liquid at {shop.url}/#organization. This section renders nothing." }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
